      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on ACC to around ₹1,865 from about ₹1,907. This reflects updated assumptions that include more moderate revenue growth expectations, a slightly higher discount rate and a marginally richer forward P/E, partly offset by a firmer profit margin outlook.",
