      "title": "ACC: Upcoming Board And Shareholder Meetings Will Support Bullish Repricing",
      "body": "Analysts have slightly reduced their price target on ACC, with fair value moving from about ₹2,004.47 to ₹2,001.44 as they refine assumptions related to the discount rate, long-term revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E. What's in the News ACC has scheduled a Board Meeting on Jan 28, 2026, at 11:00 Indian Standard Time to consider and approve the unaudited financial results for the quarter and nine months ended Dec 31, 2025, and to approve changes in Senior Management Personnel (Key Developments).",
